<title>POLAND: BIG PRICES NEW ISSUE AT PLN 3.3-5.3.</title>
<headline>BIG PRICES NEW ISSUE AT PLN 3.3-5.3.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  new common shares</p>
<p> Pricing Range (PLN):		  3.30-5.30</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 75,000,000</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		163,470,872</p>
<p> Lead Domestic Manager:		BIG-BG sp zoo.</p>
<p> GDR Manager:			    Merrill Lynch International</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter:		     N.A.</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			refinance acquisition of</p>
<p>					     Bank Gdanski, supporting</p>
<p>					     banks' integration</p>
<p> Tranches		     No of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>				  Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Domestic		     20,000,000	     July 21-25</p>
<p> GDRs			   55,000,000   book building Aug 1-5</p>
<p>NOTES: Up to 15 million shares can be moved to the GDR</p>
<p>tranche. Bank of New York is depository bank for GDRs and Bank</p>
<p>Pekao SA is the custodian bank.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
